# Temporary geometry-only distance margin cleanup; never an MD model.
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
atom_modify sort 0 0
read_data geometry_precondition.data
mass 1 183.84
mass 2 107.8682
pair_style hybrid/overlay soft 3.0 morse 3.0
pair_coeff 1 1 soft 50.0 2.80
pair_coeff 1 1 morse 1.0 2.0 2.745077896545 3.0
pair_coeff 1 2 soft 50.0 2.75
pair_coeff 1 2 morse 0.0 2.0 2.8 3.0
pair_coeff 2 2 soft 50.0 2.48
pair_coeff 2 2 morse 1.0 2.0 2.888123339598 3.0
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
fix bottomcap all wall/harmonic zlo 0.0 100.0 2.0 2.0
fix topcap all wall/harmonic zhi 200.0 100.0 2.0 2.0
variable fmag atom sqrt(fx*fx+fy*fy+fz*fz)
variable f2 atom fx*fx+fy*fy+fz*fz
compute fmax all reduce max v_fmag
compute f2mean all reduce ave v_f2
variable frms equal sqrt(c_f2mean)
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step pe c_fmax v_frms
thermo_modify flush yes
min_style fire
min_modify dmax 0.01
minimize 0.0 1.0 10000 50000
write_data geometry_precondition_wmargin.data
write_dump all custom geometry_precondition_wmargin.dump id type x y z fx fy fz modify sort id
